<https://example.org/imaks/id/document/DS_THERMAL_SENSORS> a im:Document ;
    im:documentText """[page 1]
Industrial Thermal Sensor Series 2200 — Datasheet
Document: DS-THERM-2200 | Rev: Rev D | Date: 2024-06-01 | Author: ThermoSense GmbH — Engineering Division
1. Temperature Sensor TMP-2210 — Specifications
Parameter
Value
